cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FontVibe Fancy Text: Unicode Text Styles"
message: "If you use this dataset or library, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "FontVibe"
    website: "https://fontvibe.ai"
abstract: >-
  120 Unicode "fancy text" styles (mathematical alphanumerics, enclosed
  alphanumerics, small caps, superscript, upside-down, combining-mark styles,
  deterministic zalgo, lookalike scripts, braille, morse and more) defined as
  language-neutral JSON pipelines, with dependency-free JavaScript and Python
  implementations verified identical to FontVibe's production code, and a
  reverse table mapping styled characters back to plain ASCII.
keywords:
  - unicode
  - fancy-text
  - text-styles
  - font-generator
  - mathematical-alphanumeric-symbols
  - zalgo
  - normalization
  - homoglyphs
  - dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://fontvibe.ai/tools/fancy-font-generator"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Funovate-Technology/fontvibe-fancy-text"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
